  "description": {
   "content": [
    {
     "content": [
      {
       "text": "Fcrepo4-vagrant indexes content to Solr and Fuseki. It uses the default configuration of fcrepo-solr-indexing and fcrepo-triplestore-indexing. ",
       "type": "text"
      },
      {
       "type": "hardBreak"
      },
      {
       "marks": [
        {
         "attrs": {
          "href": "https://github.com/fcrepo4-exts/fcrepo-camel-toolbox/tree/master/fcrepo-indexing-solr#configuration"
         },
         "type": "link"
        }
       ],
       "text": "https://github.com/fcrepo4-exts/fcrepo-camel-toolbox/tree/master/fcrepo-indexing-solr#configuration",
       "type": "text"
      }
     ],
     "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
     "content": [
      {
       "text": "When performing automated testing for Fedora using the fcrepo-tests the fast addition and removal causes fcrepo-XXX-indexing fails to retrieve the resource (because is it deleted) but it will retry each item a total of 10 times.",
       "type": "text"
      }
     ],
     "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
     "content": [
      {
       "text": "This ticket is to reduce this number to 1 inside of fcrepo4-vagrant. This is purely a configuration change and does not affect any of the components (fcrepo4 or fcrepo-camel-toolbox).",
       "type": "text"
      }
     ],
     "type": "paragraph"
    }
   ],
